    {
     "type": "text",
     "content": "A6 · Cascade, typing and scramble. Cards fade in and rise 18 px one after another, 55 ms apart (3.3). The greeting types letter by letter with a gold caret (1.1). Eyebrow and subtitle slide up from behind a mask (1.3). The four numbers decode from random symbols into the real value (1.2).",
