    {
     "type": "text",
     "content": "C5 · Cursor glow and magnetic button. The custom cursor: a gold dot with a ring that follows softly and grows over anything clickable (4.1). Over the satellite banner the picture becomes sharp in a circle around the cursor, the rest stays blurred; cards light up under the cursor. Main buttons pull toward the cursor when it comes within 46 px (4.2).",
